{"id":"0138480e8111b6c9","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-mathias-extension.md","title":"ZFC Mathias Extension","display":"df-zfc-mathias-extension — ZFC Mathias Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-mathias-extension","aliases":["58-df-zfc-mathias-extension"],"display":"df-zfc-mathias-extension — ZFC Mathias Extension","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-extension]]","[[58-df-forcing]]","[[58-df-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-mathias-condition]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-mathias-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-mathias-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-mathias-extension — ZFC Mathias Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e919bc05b2851392\" href=\"?note=e919bc05b2851392\" title=\"58-df-extension\">58-df-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"58-df-forcing\">58-df-forcing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0c503b9bc4320741\" href=\"?note=0c503b9bc4320741\" title=\"58-df-zfc-mathias-condition\">58-df-zfc-mathias-condition</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=(s,A),q=(t,B)\">\\(p=(s,A),q=(t,B)\\)</span> (Mathias forcing conditions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0c503b9bc4320741\" href=\"?note=0c503b9bc4320741\" title=\"58-df-zfc-mathias-condition\">58-df-zfc-mathias-condition</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> (the fixed free filter used by the Mathias forcing)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MathiasCondition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MathiasCondition}_S\\)</span> (Mathias-condition predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0c503b9bc4320741\" href=\"?note=0c503b9bc4320741\" title=\"58-df-zfc-mathias-condition\">58-df-zfc-mathias-condition</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MathiasExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MathiasExtension}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}mathias\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{MathiasExtension}_S(q,p,F) \\leftrightarrow \\exists s,t,A,B\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{MathiasCondition}_S(p,s,A,F)\\land\\mathrm{MathiasCondition}_S(q,t,B,F)\\land s\\subseteq t\\subseteq s\\cup A\\land B\\subseteq A\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}mathias\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{MathiasExtension}_S(q,p,F) \\leftrightarrow \\exists s,t,A,B\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{MathiasCondition}_S(p,s,A,F)\\land\\mathrm{MathiasCondition}_S(q,t,B,F)\\land s\\subseteq t\\subseteq s\\cup A\\land B\\subseteq A\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Besides enlarging the stem and shrinking the reservoir, an extension may add to its stem only points from the old reservoir.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-extension","status":"resolved","id":"e919bc05b2851392","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-forcing]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"65d9a1e690c32aad","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-mathias-condition","status":"resolved","id":"0c503b9bc4320741","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-mathias-condition]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-mathias-condition","status":"resolved","id":"0c503b9bc4320741","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p=(s,A),q=(t,B)$ (Mathias forcing conditions, see [[58-df-zfc-mathias-condition]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-mathias-condition","status":"resolved","id":"0c503b9bc4320741","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MathiasCondition}_S$ (Mathias-condition predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-mathias-condition]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p=(s,A),q=(t,B)","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MathiasCondition}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MathiasExtension}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}mathias\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{MathiasExtension}_S(q,p,F) \\leftrightarrow \\exists s,t,A,B\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{MathiasCondition}_S(p,s,A,F)\\land\\mathrm{MathiasCondition}_S(q,t,B,F)\\land s\\subseteq t\\subseteq s\\cup A\\land B\\subseteq A\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1141,"backlinks":[{"id":"52ebe7de18dba8af","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MathiasExtension}_S$ (extension predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-mathias-extension.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2524","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-mathias-extension.md|58-df-zfc-mathias-extension]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","e919bc05b2851392","d06ac5a66d69d291","65d9a1e690c32aad","0c503b9bc4320741"]}